From 89fbc7421b36d13c5e1f53084a33723ec73ddc36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: acolomba <acolomba@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:52:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(coding-agent): let input transforms skip prompt template
 expansion

An input handler that returns { action: "transform" } could not stop pi
from expanding /skill:name and /template in the transformed text, so a
handler that already expanded a command saw its result expanded again
when it started with "/". The transform result now accepts
expandPromptTemplates (default true), matching the prompt() and
sendUserMessage() option. When false, prompt(), steer(), and followUp()
send the transformed text as is. A later transform that omits the
option keeps the value an earlier handler set.
